{"id":"6114f5d4fdd10493","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring.md","title":"ZFC Algebra2 Image Subring","display":"df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Image Subring","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring","aliases":["58-df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring"],"display":"df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Image Subring","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-ring]]","[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-algebra2-image-subring — ZFC Algebra2 Image Subring"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1c30d21ea7b443f6\" href=\"?note=1c30d21ea7b443f6\" title=\"58-df-ring\">58-df-ring</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"58-df-ring-homomorphism\">58-df-ring-homomorphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\">\\(R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R\\)</span> (domain ring and operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S\">\\(S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S\\)</span> (codomain ring and operations)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:R\\to S\">\\(f:R\\to S\\)</span> (ring homomorphism)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> (image subset of codomain)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RingHom}_S\\)</span> (ring-homomorphism predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"28f002080d71355a\" href=\"?note=28f002080d71355a\" title=\"58-df-ring-homomorphism\">58-df-ring-homomorphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubring}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubring}_S\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}image\\text{-}subring\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S(I,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\land I=f[R]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}image\\text{-}subring\\text{-}explicit} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S(I,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RingHom}_S(f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\land I=f[R]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}image\\text{-}subring\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubring}_S(I,f,R,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S(I,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}algebra2\\text{-}image\\text{-}subring\\text{-}projection} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubring}_S(I,f,R,S)\\leftrightarrow\\exists +_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S\\in V\\;\\mathrm{ZfcAlgebra2ImageSubringStructure}_S(I,f,R,+_R,\\cdot_R,0_R,1_R,S,+_S,\\cdot_S,0_S,1_S)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The carrier <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=f[R]\">\\(I=f[R]\\)</span> inherits the operations of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span>; the explicit form records those operations, while the four-argument compatibility form existentially binds them.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring","status":"resolved","id":"1c30d21ea7b443f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-ring-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-ring-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"28f002080d71355a","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ri